        <definition>uint32_t sl_bt_evt_connection_statistics_s::num_total_connection_events</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>num_total_connection_events</name>
        <qualifiedname>sl_bt_evt_connection_statistics_s::num_total_connection_events</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The total number of connection events that would have occurred on this connection if no packets were lost. This count therefore includes also connection events that were missed due to errors (see <computeroutput>num_missed_connection_events</computeroutput>). In the Peripheral device this count does not include connection events where the Peripheral deliberately did not listen due to Peripheral latency. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
